<title>LATVIA: Two out of three Latvian T-bill yields fall.</title>
<headline>Two out of three Latvian T-bill yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields on two out of three maturities of Latvian Treasury bills dipped at auction on Wednesday, with only the 182-day rate rising, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>No one-year bills were sold today.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD   (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID    SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	9.66	  9.89	   1.25   2.53   1.25</p>
<p> 91-day	10.14	 10.25	  1.50   3.26   1.50</p>
<p> 182-day     10.65	 10.44	  1.75   3.73   1.75</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
